@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] documentation-evidence-scope
Documentation MUST distinguish accepted decisions, implemented code and executed
acceptance tests. Commands not run and tests limited to one physical host MUST
NOT be described as verified production or independent-host behavior.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:architecture] documentation-preserve-decisions
Material replacements of accepted decisions MUST preserve the original rationale
and use reciprocal ADR supersession links. Contract backfills MUST NOT silently
change accepted product requirements or turn incidental implementation details
into new architectural decisions.
